{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3468390/extras/f6ca795db09a1776bffa2809bdc47e14.avif?t=1756839924\" width=615 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>I've been trying to contact someone out there, if someone can hear me, please answer me and connect to my core.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Won't you\u00a0accept my call? Won't you enter\u00a0a\u00a0new\u00a0world?</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A passion project made alone with love, Wishbind is an exploration based, hand-crafted 2D platformer collect-a-thon, in which you'll explore a vast world to gather a special kind of leaf essence, while interacting with  characters and discovering many secrets throughout the locale.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a hand-crafted world in search of a special kind of leaf in a non-linear way!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use a wide array of available moves to overcome platforming challenges for different rewards!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Follow the story of some NPCs!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find unlockable colors for your character!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enter photo mode to take screenshots of your gameplay at almost any time!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Search every last corner of the map to find hidden secrets and easter eggs!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy the game either in english, or spanish!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cute animals!</p></li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Connection Established","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3468390/29426eaaae6276e701b2e2e6bcf4cd1073eb6ef1.jpg"},{"name":"Connection Ended","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3468390/16c64fd7dc82c9c5fb2f8e3e2e3bcc72d116d3dc.jpg"},{"name":"Connection ???","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3468390/ff686f63ccd4de1ad8ae16b80a05d2378f2e3c92.jpg"}],"total":3},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3468390?t=1756839924","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3468390/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1756839924","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3468390/0aa772ae141b5447322505e392531361c289e1c3/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1756839924","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3468390/0aa772ae141b5447322505e392531361c289e1c3/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1756839924","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Color Alternatives","id":66},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":3468520,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3468390/extras/f6ca795db09a1776bffa2809bdc47e14.avif?t=1756839924\" width=615 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>I've been trying to contact someone out there, if someone can hear me, please answer me and connect to my core.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Won't you\u00a0accept my call? Won't you enter\u00a0a\u00a0new\u00a0world?</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A passion project made alone with love, Wishbind is an exploration based, hand-crafted 2D platformer collect-a-thon, in which you'll explore a vast world to gather a special kind of leaf essence, while interacting with  characters and discovering many secrets throughout the locale.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a hand-crafted world in search of a special kind of leaf in a non-linear way!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use a wide array of available moves to overcome platforming challenges for different rewards!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Follow the story of some NPCs!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find unlockable colors for your character!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enter photo mode to take screenshots of your gameplay at almost any time!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Search every last corner of the map to find hidden secrets and easter eggs!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy the game either in english, or spanish!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cute animals!</p></li></ul>","developers":["Imaginative Meta Space"],"dlc":[3926680],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3468390/header.jpg?t=1756839924","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Any distribution should work (64-bits)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Quad-core<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 2 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Support for OpenGL 3.3<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1 GB available space</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Mini